{"feeds": {"type": "feed", "id": "187702008971600897", "url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/feed/1e0ac39f8952b2e7f0807313cf2633d25078a171.xml", "title": "腾讯技术工程", "description": "腾讯技术官方号。腾讯技术创新、前沿领域发布解读平台。\n(wechat feed made by @ttttmr https://wechat2rss.xlab.app)", "siteUrl": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/feed/1e0ac39f8952b2e7f0807313cf2633d25078a171.xml", "image": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Iic9WLWEQMg2jTKicld7jhiagcz7jJxuYcpjicxAAiaVaNpdIiabCLIxOHIZFVsWH3cRNQjLF1TBznTJc/0", "errorMessage": null, "errorAt": null, "ownerUserId": null}, "entries": {"feedId": "187702008971600897", "id": "1271401709997953025", "title": "CubeSandbox v0.7.0 发布：沙箱跨机流动，集群平滑演进", "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5ODYwMjI2MA==&mid=2649803909&idx=2&sn=75a522e38308f9634ebaf54d7355af29", "content": "<p><span>腾讯技术工程</span> <span>2026-08-31 17:36</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">广东</span></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  <p><img src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=de6886b8&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FKVER9adz90504lPN9H9PprRyPP7lGLJyib92fkWkPSErOX46T6gf085a9S3ib8BtCzq2stDKcqQBiaZCjicyKv4iaKraL9TrxhiaTu16KMMY2tJco%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\"></p>\n  <p>跨机暂停恢复、组件多版本共存，它们来啦！</p>\n  <p><span><img src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=2d8d8914&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_gif%2F2fq1Ja8dSurwZHMjnYibpzliae3I28L30FLPpPlQIOUe0vMib7FhlDp9m2XPbFoibH3EM4eMCItwLyW0JVCNDUsBXdWgDtiaxtDRTGug5gibicoicjs%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dgif%26from%3Dappmsg%26wxfrom%3D5%26wx_lazy%3D1%26tp%3Dwebp%23imgIndex%3D0\"></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 17px;line-height: 2;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.2px;\"><span>在 v0.6.0 中，我们把 CubeSandbox 送进了 Kubernetes，也交付了兼容 E2B 的 Volume 框架。控制面能以标准工作负载运行，计算节点作为可调度资源纳入集群，存储的选择权回到了用户手里。</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 17px;line-height: 2;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.2px;\"><span>但不少团队真正把集群跑起来之后，会遇到一个最大的问题：沙箱只能待在一开始的那台机器上。 暂停的沙箱换不了机器恢复，快照也只能在原节点用；更麻烦的是，组件一升级，之前做好的模板和快照就对不上了，只能重做。这两件事，正是生产用户最在意的。</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 17px;line-height: 2;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.2px;\"><span>于是，在 v0.7.0 中，我们将这些“需求”正式推上了研发日程：让沙箱跨机器流动，让升级不再打断已有资产。</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 34px 0px 20px;text-align: center;\"></p><h1 style=\"margin: 0px;font-size: 18px;font-weight: 700;color: rgb(47, 95, 159);line-height: 1.5;letter-spacing: 0.4px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(107, 167, 220);font-weight: 400;margin-right: 10px;\"><span>◆</span></span><span>四大核心特性</span><span style=\"color: rgb(107, 167, 220);font-weight: 400;margin-left: 10px;\"><span>◆</span></span></h1><p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 26px 0px 14px;padding: 0px 0px 7px;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(220, 234, 247);\"></p><h2 style=\"margin: 0px;font-size: 16px;font-weight: 700;color: rgb(47, 95, 159);line-height: 1.45;letter-spacing: 0.25px;\" class=\"\"><span>1、跨机暂停恢复</span></h2><p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 17px;line-height: 2;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.2px;\"><span>过去，沙箱的 </span><code style=\"font-size: 13.5px;color: rgb(47, 95, 159);background: rgb(238, 245, 252);padding: 1px 5px;border-radius: 4px;border: 1px solid rgb(199, 221, 240);font-family: &#x22;JetBrains Mono&#x22;, Menlo, Consolas, &#x22;Courier New&#x22;, monospace;\" class=\"\"><span>pause/resume</span></code><span> 与基于快照的创建都绑定在单台宿主机上，在哪台机器暂停，就只能在哪台机器恢复。</span><span style=\"font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;line-height: 2;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.2px;color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\">v0.7.0 </span><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>基于 S3 后端存储，</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>将</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>沙箱的内存与文件系统状态落到共享对象存储，从而支持在 A 节点暂停、在 B 节点恢复，也支持在任意已同步节点上用同一份快照拉起新沙箱。</span></strong></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 17px;line-height: 2;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.2px;\"><span>举个例子：一台计算节点要下线检修，上面还挂着一批暂停的沙箱。过去只能干等它们在本机恢复，或直接丢弃；现在可以把这些沙箱迁移到别的节点再恢复，节点排空不必再以牺牲沙箱为代价。再比如 Agent 训练这类需要大规模并行、频繁暂停恢复的场景，调度器可以按各节点的实时负载把沙箱放到最空闲的机器上。</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 17px;line-height: 2;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.2px;\"><span>该能力当前为预览版，默认由内置 MinIO 承载 S3 后端，用户也可自行指定对象存储。</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 26px 0px 14px;padding: 0px 0px 7px;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(220, 234, 247);\"></p><h2 style=\"margin: 0px;font-size: 16px;font-weight: 700;color: rgb(47, 95, 159);line-height: 1.45;letter-spacing: 0.25px;\" class=\"\"><span>2. 组件多版本共存</span></h2><p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 17px;line-height: 2;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.2px;\"><span>跨机流动会涉及一个连带问题：不同节点、不同时间构建的模板和快照，可能依赖不同版本的运行时组件；组件一旦升级，老的模板、快照就对不上，只能重做。</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>v0.7.0 让计算节点保留历史版本的组件，模板与快照不再因组件升级而失效，升级也不会打断已有实例的 pause/resume。</span></strong></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 17px;line-height: 2;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.2px;\"><span>在这之前，一个已经跑在生产上的集群，如果想升级到新版本修 bug，可能需要对现存的模板和快照集体作废，业务得停下来重新烤制。因此，对于需要长期迭代、持续升级的集群，v0.7.0 的这项特性更新，是从「每次升级都重做」到「升级和存量资产解耦」的重要转变。</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 26px 0px 14px;padding: 0px 0px 7px;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(220, 234, 247);\"></p><h2 style=\"margin: 0px;font-size: 16px;font-weight: 700;color: rgb(47, 95, 159);line-height: 1.45;letter-spacing: 0.25px;\" class=\"\"><span>3、网络子系统重构，加速沙箱网络创建流程</span></h2><p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 17px;line-height: 2;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.2px;\"><span>网络创建在沙箱冷启动链路上一直是关键路径，批量拉起时尤为明显。</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>v0.7.0</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>将</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>原先独立的 NetworkAgent 整体合并</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>到</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span> Cubelet</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span> 中</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>，</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>减少</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>沙箱</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>创建</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>流程</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>中的</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>RPC</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>调用</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>；</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>同时</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>优化</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>e</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>B</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>P</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>F</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>网络</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>策略</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>下发</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>路径</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>，</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>大幅</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>降低</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>带有</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>网络</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>规则</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>的</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>沙箱</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>的</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>创建</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>延迟</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>；</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>并且</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>优化</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>高并发</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>创建</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>时</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>Tap</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>设备</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>分配</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>的</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>稳定性</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>。</span></strong></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 17px;line-height: 2;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.2px;\"><span>一个请求同时拉起上百个沙箱时，每个沙箱少两次 RPC、少一次 RCU 等待，这些开销随批量成比例叠加，冷启动时间因此下降。TAP 生命周期重构之后，节点重启、沙箱恢复时的网络异常也更少复现。</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 26px 0px 14px;padding: 0px 0px 7px;border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(220, 234, 247);\"></p><h2 style=\"margin: 0px;font-size: 16px;font-weight: 700;color: rgb(47, 95, 159);line-height: 1.45;letter-spacing: 0.25px;\" class=\"\"><span>4. 控制面、运维架构分离</span></h2><p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 17px;line-height: 2;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.2px;\"><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>v0.7.0 </span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>将</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>节点管理</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>等</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>运维</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>能力从 CubeMaster </span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>迁移至</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span> CubeOps。</span></strong><span>CubeOps 现在承载完整的节点管理，默认双副本部署，并用 cubeopscli 取代原先 cubemastercli 的 node 子命令；Web UI 同步提供节点隔离/解除隔离和节点操作记录查看。</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 17px;line-height: 2;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.2px;\"><span>那么，运维发现某台节点磁盘异常后，可以在 Web UI 上将这台节点隔离，让存量沙箱继续运行，新沙箱调度到别处。这样的优化能让组件职责边界更清楚：调度归 CubeMaster，运维归 CubeOps。</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 34px 0px 20px;text-align: center;\"></p><h1 style=\"margin: 0px;font-size: 18px;font-weight: 700;color: rgb(47, 95, 159);line-height: 1.5;letter-spacing: 0.4px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(107, 167, 220);font-weight: 400;margin-right: 10px;\"><span>◆</span></span><span>其他值得一提的特性</span><span style=\"color: rgb(107, 167, 220);font-weight: 400;margin-left: 10px;\"><span>◆</span></span></h1><p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 17px;line-height: 2;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.2px;\"><span>四条核心特性之外，v0.7.0 还重点实现了一批功能增强和 bug 修复。</span></p><div style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 8px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px;padding-left: 0px;font-size: 15px;line-height: 1.9;color: rgb(36, 54, 75);text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(107, 167, 220);font-weight: 600;margin-right: 2px;\"><span>◆ </span></span><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>三语言 SDK 能力拉齐。</span></strong><span> Volume CRUD 与 volumeMounts 挂载此前只有 Python 支持，v0.7.0 在 Go 与 Node SDK 上补齐，三语言能力拉齐。模板别名此前覆盖不完整，这一版补齐了构建期别名与现有模板别名管理两个阶段，覆盖 Go / Node / Python。</span></p></div><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 17px;line-height: 2;text-align: left;letter-spacing: 0.2px;\"><span>此外，Python SDK 支持用 </span><code style=\"font-size: 13.5px;color: rgb(47, 95, 159);background: rgb(238, 245, 252);padding: 1px 5px;border-radius: 4px;border: 1px solid rgb(199, 221, 240);font-family: &#x22;JetBrains Mono&#x22;, Menlo, Consolas, &#x22;Courier New&#x22;, monospace;\" class=\"\"><span>distribution_scope</span></code><span> 显式指定沙箱放到哪些节点或区域，Node SDK 支持运行时设置 </span><span style=\"font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 0.2px;font-size: 13.5px;color: rgb(47, 95, 159);background: rgb(238, 245, 252);padding: 1px 5px;border-radius: 4px;border: 1px solid rgb(199, 221, 240);font-family: &#x22;JetBrains Mono&#x22;, Menlo, Consolas, &#x22;Courier New&#x22;, monospace;\">NEVER_TIMEOUT</span><span>，Go SDK 新增按用户身份隔离的文件视图 </span><code style=\"font-size: 13.5px;color: rgb(47, 95, 159);background: rgb(238, 245, 252);padding: 1px 5px;border-radius: 4px;border: 1px solid rgb(199, 221, 240);font-family: &#x22;JetBrains Mono&#x22;, Menlo, Consolas, &#x22;Courier New&#x22;, monospace;\" class=\"\"><span>Files.ForUser</span></code><span>。</span></p><div style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 8px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px;padding-left: 0px;font-size: 15px;line-height: 1.9;color: rgb(36, 54, 75);text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(107, 167, 220);font-weight: 600;margin-right: 2px;\"><span>◆ </span></span><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>存储块设备与模板来源扩展。</span></strong><span> 新增基于 SPDK 的 CubeS3lvol COW：一个以 S3 对象存储为后端的远程写时复制块设备，本地写时分配、异步落 S3，经 </span><code style=\"font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-size: 15px;line-height: 1.9;color: rgb(36, 54, 75);text-align: justify;\" class=\"\"><span>NVMe-oF/TCP</span></code><span style=\"font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-size: 15px;line-height: 1.9;color: rgb(36, 54, 75);text-align: justify;\"> Loo</span><span>pback 导出给宿主，支持快照/克隆与跨节点导入导出，靠本地 WAL + journal 保证崩溃一致性。v0.7.0 内置 MinIO 作为默认 S3 卷后端，开箱即用；私有 HTTP 镜像仓库也能直接作为模板来源，不必再为内网镜像单独搭 HTTPS。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px;padding-left: 0px;font-size: 15px;line-height: 1.9;color: rgb(36, 54, 75);text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(107, 167, 220);font-weight: 600;margin-right: 2px;\"><span>◆ </span></span><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>网络策略动态化与转发可配置。</span></strong><span> 沙箱支持在运行时动态更新网络策略，无需重建即可调整规则；CubeEgress 的七层转发规则支持自定义端口，CubeProxy 支持自定义管理端口并新增明文 gRPC ingress，CubeVS 引入同子网 MAC 地址学习，避开非 hairpin 通信的黑洞。passfd 改用 bare-pipe vsock 直连，提升业务进程的 IO 效率。内核与 guest 镜像产物改为独立发布，发版时从固定的 kernel-release-* / guest-image-* 拉取，不再每次重新编译。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px;padding-left: 0px;font-size: 15px;line-height: 1.9;color: rgb(36, 54, 75);text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(107, 167, 220);font-weight: 600;margin-right: 2px;\"><span>◆ </span></span><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>高频</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>问题</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>、</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>稳定性</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>问题</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>等</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>b</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>u</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>g</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>修复</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>。 </span></strong><span>v0.7.0 集中处理了一批生产环境里出现频率较高的问题：暂停/恢复引发的状态不一致、僵尸进程与删除异常（PR #978 / #985 / #1137 / #1274），快照性能问题（PR #1300 / #1504），并发创建沙箱时的模板缓存数据竞争（PR #1366），以及节点重启场景下 TAP 设备恢复异常（PR #930 / #987 / #1207）。</span></p></div><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 34px 0px 20px;text-align: center;\"></p><h1 style=\"margin: 0px;font-size: 18px;font-weight: 700;color: rgb(47, 95, 159);line-height: 1.5;letter-spacing: 0.4px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(107, 167, 220);font-weight: 400;margin-right: 10px;\"><span>◆</span></span><span>Coming Soon……</span><span style=\"color: rgb(107, 167, 220);font-weight: 400;margin-left: 10px;\"><span>◆</span></span></h1><p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 17px;line-height: 2;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.2px;\"><span>跨机能力落地后，Cube Sandbox 会继续沿着「云原生 + 高可用」方向，向更深处挖掘：</span></p><div style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 8px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px;padding-left: 0px;font-size: 15px;line-height: 1.9;color: rgb(36, 54, 75);text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(107, 167, 220);font-weight: 600;margin-right: 2px;\"><span>◆ </span></span><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>沙箱异常恢复</span></strong><span>：自动检测并恢复 VM Crash、shim 进程卡死、网络分区等状态，恢复策略可配置（重启 / 回滚快照 / 向调用方报错）；</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px;padding-left: 0px;font-size: 15px;line-height: 1.9;color: rgb(36, 54, 75);text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(107, 167, 220);font-weight: 600;margin-right: 2px;\"><span>◆ </span></span><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>调度与运维能力增强</span></strong><span>：资源感知调度、亲和/反亲和规则、优先级类，以及在线资源均衡和带沙箱迁移的节点排空。</span></p></div><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 17px;line-height: 2;text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 0.2px;\"><span>更近的迭代版本（v0.7.1或 0.8.0）中，有两项我们正在推进的：1）</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>控制</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>链路</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>全路径高可用</span></strong><span>：模版制作管理从CubeMaster分离；CLM（cube-lifecycle-manager）支持多副本部署； 2）</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>沙箱异常恢复，节点故障沙箱可以跨节点恢复</span></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(47, 95, 159);font-weight: 700;\"><span>。</span></strong></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 17px;line-height: 2;text-align: left;letter-spacing: 0.2px;\"><span>欢迎给 Cube 提 PR 或 Issue，参与 Roadmap 设计讨论，一起推动 Cube Sandbox 的演进。</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;margin: 0px 0px 17px;line-height: 2;text-align: left;letter-spacing: 0.2px;\"><span>完整 Changelog：</span><code style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;line-height: 2;text-align: left;letter-spacing: 0.2px;\" class=\"\"><span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 122, 170);font-style: italic;text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://github\" target=\"_blank\">https://github</a></span></span></code><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 54, 75);font-family: &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, -apple-system, &#x22;system-ui&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-